From 337906939084775aa16c2dc4bb65086319a14e14 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: fi3 <you@example.com>
Date: Wed, 24 Jun 2026 01:30:01 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 3/3] ADD review-completion prompts so patch agents close after
 user confirmation

Clean reviews append a typed feature-done prompt to the reviewed patch agent and select that chat so the user can confirm completion immediately. The terminal adapter keeps the prompt marker private, closes chats on yes responses, and reopens or continues the patch-agent path when work is not done.
