+The terminal adapter treats the review completion prompt on a selected patch-agent chat as a
+feature-done confirmation. A yes response records the answer, appends a closure line, hides that
+chat, and returns focus to the command interface. A no response records the answer and keeps the
+patch-agent chat open. Other text reopens the chat and is sent as the next patch-agent message.
